WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:02.448
There's one job in your business that

00:00:02.575 --> 00:00:03.667
nobody wants.

00:00:03.899 --> 00:00:04.688
You know the one.

00:00:04.955 --> 00:00:06.883
It gets done by hand every time,

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:09.135
because that's how it's always been done.

00:00:09.565 --> 00:00:11.248
Two hours a go, forty times a

00:00:11.318 --> 00:00:13.733
month, and nobody has a spare afternoon

00:00:13.802 --> 00:00:14.557
to fix it.

00:00:14.917 --> 00:00:16.020
You don't need advice.

00:00:16.287 --> 00:00:17.738
You need someone to come and take

00:00:17.773 --> 00:00:18.597
it off you.

00:00:19.297 --> 00:00:20.470
So that's what we do.

00:00:20.957 --> 00:00:23.140
We don't send a proposal and disappear.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.021
We sit with your team, in your

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:27.227
business, and learn how the work actually

00:00:27.261 --> 00:00:27.935
gets done.

00:00:28.295 --> 00:00:29.827
Then we build it so it runs

00:00:29.897 --> 00:00:30.524
itself.

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.637
The person who tells you what it'll

00:00:32.683 --> 00:00:34.355
take is the person who builds it.

00:00:34.843 --> 00:00:37.072
No sales team, no handover.

00:00:37.432 --> 00:00:39.777
Something working in weeks, not next year.

00:00:40.477 --> 00:00:41.185
Here's one.

00:00:41.383 --> 00:00:43.229
A training company was signing up students

00:00:43.263 --> 00:00:43.937
by hand.

00:00:44.366 --> 00:00:45.783
Two hours a student.

00:00:46.143 --> 00:00:47.745
We took it apart and rebuilt it.

00:00:48.105 --> 00:00:49.417
Now it takes two minutes.

00:00:49.846 --> 00:00:52.598
Sixty times faster, and about thirty-nine hours

00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:54.281
back on every group of twenty.

00:00:54.769 --> 00:00:55.988
Nobody wrote a report.

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:57.381
We just fixed it.

00:00:58.081 --> 00:01:00.043
And we build the thing itself.

00:01:00.473 --> 00:01:03.189
BrightCover: a website and the whole system

00:01:03.236 --> 00:01:05.221
behind it, live in three weeks.

00:01:05.453 --> 00:01:08.089
NookTek: a website, and the student portal

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:10.132
behind it, that they run themselves.

00:01:10.562 --> 00:01:13.267
SeatStep: our own app, on iPhone and

00:01:13.337 --> 00:01:15.438
Android, that walks you to your seat

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:16.402
in a stadium.

00:01:16.599 --> 00:01:19.861
Websites, apps, dashboards, AI that does a

00:01:19.954 --> 00:01:20.825
real job.

00:01:21.255 --> 00:01:22.601
Same people every time.

00:01:23.301 --> 00:01:25.251
This normally costs what a big company

00:01:25.321 --> 00:01:26.087
pays for it.

00:01:26.447 --> 00:01:28.851
We built ours for businesses your size,

00:01:28.978 --> 00:01:30.708
because that's where the work happens.

00:01:31.068 --> 00:01:32.972
And when we're done, it's yours.

00:01:33.332 --> 00:01:35.851
The code, the system, the instructions, and

00:01:35.886 --> 00:01:37.581
the ability to run it without us.

00:01:37.941 --> 00:01:38.916
If you still need us in a

00:01:38.986 --> 00:01:40.611
year, we built it wrong.

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:42.283
Give us twenty minutes.

00:01:42.481 --> 00:01:44.640
Let's give you your time back, while

00:01:44.663 --> 00:01:46.056
we grow your business.
